@baseUrl = https://localhost:5001
@writerToken = REPLACE_LOCALLY_WITH_A_VALID_WRITER_TOKEN

### Development demo sign-in; retain the returned cookie
GET {{baseUrl}}/auth/login?returnUrl=/scalar

### Register the complete example first. Fake startup has no customers.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"CUST-001","displayName":"Registered customer"}

### Register a customer whose fake billing is unavailable
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"CUST-WARN","displayName":"Registered billing example"}

### All registered customers; requires the reader cookie, returns [] before registration
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers

### Complete registered customer
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/CUST-001/overview

### Partial billing data
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/CUST-WARN/overview

### Required source unavailable
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/CUST-FAIL/overview

### Customer absent
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/CUST-MISSING/overview

### Writes require permissions=customers.write. Local: dotnet user-jwts create --project src/Web --claim permissions=customers.write
### The Development demo reader remains read-only. Never commit real tokens.
### For OIDC cookie sessions retain the cookie and add X-CSRF-TOKEN from /auth/antiforgery.
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/customers
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"customerId":"WRITE-1","displayName":"Created customer"}

### Replace all editable fields (no upsert)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/WRITE-1
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Replacement name"}

### Partial JSON object; empty objects and null displayName are invalid
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/WRITE-1
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"displayName":"Patched name"}

### Delete; returns a 200 envelope with customerId (repeat returns 404)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/WRITE-1
Authorization: Bearer {{writerToken}}

### The deleted customer is absent from the list and its overview returns 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers

### No implicit recreation
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/customers/WRITE-1/overview
